NAME
    manual - discover and present RumiAI operational manual topics

SYNOPSIS
    manual
    manual [--no-pager] <topic>
    manual [--no-pager] <owner> <topic>

DESCRIPTION
    manual accesses revision-coupled operational documentation distributed with
    the current RumiAI OS product revision.

    With no operands, manual discovers all materialized global manual topics and
    writes one owner-qualified identity per line:

        <owner> <topic>

    Discovery output is sorted lexically by owner and then topic. Topic identities
    are always owner-qualified in discovery output, even when a topic name is
    globally unique.

    With one topic operand, manual searches all materialized global owners. A
    unique match is presented, no match fails, and multiple matches fail as
    ambiguous while listing the owner-qualified invocations that resolve the
    ambiguity.

    With owner and topic operands, manual resolves only that exact owner-local
    topic and does not fall back to another owner.

OPTIONS
    --no-pager
        Write the selected topic directly to standard output instead of invoking
        the normal pager. This option is valid only when a topic is requested.

PRESENTATION
    When --no-pager is absent and standard output is a terminal, manual delegates
    presentation to the POSIX more utility.

    When standard output is not a terminal, manual writes the selected topic
    directly to standard output so that pipelines and redirections are
    non-interactive and deterministic.

    --no-pager also writes the topic directly to standard output, including when
    standard output is a terminal.

FILES
    res/<owner>/manual/<topic>
        Owner-qualified global operational manual topic.

EXIT STATUS
    0   Success.
    1   Invalid invocation or invalid owner/topic identifier.
    2   Requested topic not found.
    3   Unqualified topic is ambiguous.
    4   Execution or presentation failure, including pager failure.

EXAMPLES
    Discover all available topics:

        manual

    Present a globally unique topic:

        manual state-path

    Resolve an ambiguous topic explicitly:

        manual ai pkg
        manual sys pkg

    Write a selected topic directly without paging:

        manual --no-pager sys pkg

SEE ALSO
    more
